  "business_stars": 5,
  "review_info": [
    {
      "review_stars": 5,
      "review_date": "2021-09-21 05:09:33",
      "review_text": "Imagine having your close friends with incredible musical talent be your wedding band -- that is what hiring the Radio Prophets to play at your wedding is like! From the start, they made planning so easy, and in the end delivered above and beyond all our expectations! They made our wedding celebration so special and unforgettable, our guests are still talking about the music. Everyone loved the beautiful piano acoustics for the ceremony, the classy jazz cocktail hour and then a phenomenal dance set which got everyone on the dance floor, old and young. Their energy, positivity was unparalleled. They genuinely set the entire tone of the evening and we are so grateful for the most unforgettable wedding celebration. Thank you Radio Prophets and wishing you guys so many more lucky wedding couples to celebrate with!!"
    },
    {
      "review_stars": 5,
      "review_date": "2021-05-04 19:38:02",
      "review_text": "This band ROCKS.  They played for my wedding and were incredibly accommodating with requests for our perfect day. They set up and handled everything including the pre-event visit to the property and sound check. Communication regarding details of the event were handled quickly and professionally. I am a musician myself and was confident that this group would be amazing and I highly recommend  working with them."
    },
    {
      "review_stars": 5,
      "review_date": "2020-03-18 23:17:10",
      "review_text": "I booked this band for a launch party that I had!\nVery professional. On time. They played, without taking long breaks.\nThe music flowed so well in the background. \nMy guest kept asking where did I find them.\nI also appreciated the versatility of their music. \nGerri, the sax player was always willing to answer my questions, as well as meet in person. \nI would definitely recommend them for any special event that you might have coming up.\nTwo thumbs up!\n5+ stars!"
    }
  ]
}

