      "review_text": "Two words...\nPesto pizza\nWow!! Quality pizza I. Santa Barbara. This place is addictive. I've only had the pesto pizza and can say that I've ordered it several times. It's the only flavor I keep ordering. I highly recommend it to anyone that like garlic, red peppers, their cheese is good and pesto sauce is great!\nI have zero problems with this pizza.\nI will continue to order it..."
